QNX change from QNX's aports (core/binutils/0001.patch).

Taken from qnx-ports/aports core/binutils -- the APKBUILD the QNX Everywhere 8.0.4r1
image's package is built from.

Upstream-Status: QNX-specific

From 9eb011fdd38e51441ffdd495f1eb704cd977bdf2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shivam Saxena <shisaxena@blackberry.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Sep 2024 11:05:04 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] bfd: adding qnx bfd patches for binutils

adding proper target and bfd changes for qnx as-is from internal
svn.

With edits to add qnx target support

CLT-9242
---
